𒑰 DUB.SAR 1.0 Example: Postfix Calculation Pipelines
𒑰 Difficulty: Intermediate
𒑰 Concept: Stack Pipelines & Postfix Mathematical Verbs
𒑰 Mode: Tablet (Canonical Cuneiform)
𒑰
𒑰 Purpose:
𒑰   Demonstrates operand stack manipulation and built-in postfix mathematical verbs
𒑰   including square, half (multiplication by 0;30), floor, ceil, and nearest rounding.
𒑰
𒑰 Expected Output:
𒑰   Square of 7:
𒑰   49
𒑰   Half of 49:
𒑰   24;30
𒑰   Floor of 24;30:
𒑰   24
𒑰   Ceiling of 24;30:
𒑰   25
𒑰   Nearest to 24;30:
𒑰   25

𒂊𒁹
    val : 7

    sq :
        val
        𒅁

    h :
        sq
        0;30
        𒊭

    fl :
        h
        𒄥

    cl :
        h
        𒉏

    nr :
        h
        𒊑

𒅗𒁹
    𒁹𒀀 "Square of 7:"
    𒁹𒀀 sq
    𒁹𒀀 "Half of 49:"
    𒁹𒀀 h
    𒁹𒀀 "Floor of 24;30:"
    𒁹𒀀 fl
    𒁹𒀀 "Ceiling of 24;30:"
    𒁹𒀀 cl
    𒁹𒀀 "Nearest to 24;30:"
    𒁹𒀀 nr
